ys ahead (up to 2 weeks out); staff call to confirm. 2 hours a day, 2 bookings a week. Online orientation required first.","contact":"972-205-2000","url":"https://www.garlandtx.gov/4519/Recording-Studio","note":"Four Shure SM7dB mics, Focusrite Scarlett 18i8, 3 PTZ 4K cameras.","kind":"pod"},{"id":"p5","region":"Dallas","area":"Richardson","name":"Studio RPL – Richardson Public Library","cost":"Free","rate":"Free for residents with a Richardson library card","address":"900 Civic Center Dr, Richardson, TX 75080","lat":32.959649,"lng":-96.733473,"hours":"","book":"By appointment through the library's Book a Librarian form; open-lab drop-in times are posted on the city calendar.","contact":"","url":"https://richardsontoday.com/studio-rpl-helps-residents-produce-creative-content/","note":"Soundproofed A/V room with a mic, green screen and lights. Details come from a 2019 article; call to confirm before you go.","kind":"pod"},{"id":"p6","region":"Dallas","area":"Plano","name":"Digital Creation Space – Harrington Library (Plano)","cost":"Free","rate":"Free with a Plano library card","address":"1501 18th St, Plano, TX 75074","lat":33.023934,"lng":-96.693196,"hours":"","book":"Reserve on the City of Plano room reservations page under Digital Creation Spaces (also offered at other Plano branches).","contact":"972-941-7175","url":"https://www.plano.gov/room-reservations","note":"Shure SM57/SM58 and Blue Yeti mics, Focusrite Scarlett 2i2, Adobe Audition.","kind":"pod"},{"id":"p7","region":"Dallas","area":"Irving","name":"The Green Room – Valley Ranch Library (Irving)","cost":"Free","rate":"Free with an Irving library card","address":"401 Cimarron Trail, Irving, TX 75063","lat":32.933009,"lng":-96.95228,"hours":"Mon–Thu 10 AM–8:30 PM; Fri–Sat 10 AM–5:30 PM (from library brochure)","book":"Reserve on Irving Public Library LibCal (Valley Ranch). Ages 12–21 get priority at certain times.","contact":"","url":"https://irvinglibrary.libcal.com/spaces","note":"Two Yeti mics, a boom mi